# A closure admitted without a clean review carries its obligation in a
# trailer, and the push waits for it.
#
# The fixture runs the REAL `le commit create ... remove <spec>
# review-override "<reason>"` in a throwaway Ze checkout, runs the script, and
# asserts the commit message carries `Review-owed: <stem>: <reason>` and the
# commit holds no file under plan/verification-debt/. With a green record over
# that commit, `le commit push` is refused naming the trailer and the
# attestation that answers it (AC-13).
#
# Spec: plan/post-release/engineering/spec-verification-debt-derived.md.
# Drop the Review-owed trailer from Message (internal/le/commit/input.go) and
# seq=1 fails at review-owed-trailer-written.

option=timeout:value=60s

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le test fixture runner/commit-review-owed-trailer
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=review-owed-trailer-written
expect=stdout:contains=push-held-until-attested
